   "ul": [
    "Text editor with a central server: OT is proven and compact (Google Docs).",
    "Objects with properties (design tools, whiteboards): per-property last-writer-wins via a server is often enough (Figma).",
    "Peer-to-peer or long offline periods: CRDTs (Yjs, Automerge) merge without a central authority."
   ]
